+
+    Bugfixes:
+    ----------------------------
+    + Rack dropdown fails to populate while editing a device (#4602);
+
+    Security Fixes:
+    ----------------------------
+    + API authentication bypass via object cache key collision;
+    + Disabled API endpoints still accessible;
+    + API read only permission bypass;
+    + API controller arbitrary local file inclusion;
+    + Temporary shares can enumerate all addresses;
+    + Temporary share creation, missing permission checks;
+    + Temporary share creation, missing CSRF checks;
+    + Second-Order SQL injection in custom field reordering;
+    + Second-Order SQL injection in NAT fields;
+    + Custom field reordering, missing CSRF checks;
+    + Subnet permissions can be rewritten by any authenticated user;
+    + Cross subnet and ping insecure direct object references;
+
